<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-24756] Calcite. TPC-H query #19: too long execTime and high heap memory usage on client</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-24756</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Works for s = 0.01 but do not complete in 5 minutes for s=0.1 and s=1.0&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Use a lot of heap on client side (look similar to the query #16 case at &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-24753&quot; title=&quot;Calcite. TPC-H query #16: too long for scale=0.1 and 1.0&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-24753&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-24753&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;***&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Load test (1 client node, 3 server nodes) shows that there is huge HEAP memory usage on the client side.&lt;/p&gt;

