&lt;p&gt;For scale=0.01 one query was executed.&#160; With average 27Gb and 2Gb of heap allocation per request (on client and server correspondingly).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For scales 0.1 and 1.0 single query was cancelled after 5 minutes, having handreds of gigabytes allocated on the client side.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Reproducer:  &lt;span class=&quot;nobr&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13075687/13075687_TpchQ19Test.patch&quot; title=&quot;TpchQ19Test.patch attached to IGNITE-24756&quot;&gt;TpchQ19Test.patch&lt;sup&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;rendericon&quot; src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif&quot; height=&quot;7&quot; width=&quot;7&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</description>
